--- !u!114 &454543301
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 454543300}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Keep your hands where the crowd can't read them. Down here a drawn blade
      is a price tag.
    seconds: 8
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f94228a9073fd594594b087b65ee27e4, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: There are no sightlines. No exits I'd trust.
    seconds: 4
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9476ead8030a9c6478ac0651673c1ef7, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: That's the design. Built to make a newcomer feel small. Don't argue with
      it, just move.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 57e9a414e37191640bf043e38749f92d, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Top tier sells what shines. The deeper you go, the worse what's for sale.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 46e65382e2fab394993dca1b37665b5f, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: And my records are at the bottom. We have three days.
    seconds: 4
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b7a618f4b842ea74f94302e5ada603e2, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: If they're anywhere, they're with a broker. Man trades in the paper that
      follows dead operatives.
    seconds: 8
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b9538ed37c6e3be488be35e3282f1532, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Give me the name.
    seconds: 1.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 55d9b79c8618e0c47b1e79907bddb588, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Resh. Smuggler. Runs the routes nobody's mapped, the ones under the cells.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 05ea69306a611914e85bfbc1a98b6637, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: They say he pulls children out of the markets, one at a time, for years.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3d4ed4b04b8e23344960f7a93b662d8c, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: A smuggler with a conscience.
    seconds: 2.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1f8881f044275064cb569bdfe4b0dfa6, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: A useful one, anyway. He'll be working the market row. Let me do the talking.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 759e8eef8d8cb384891805bfcb10f1b5, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 121756430}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 594001509}
  audioSource: {fileID: 454543302}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
