--- !u!114 &875354847
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 875354846}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: You slept four hours and stood watch the other six. Trust the hull eventually.
    seconds: 8
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5785466145dd01a429cd7725d02fea18, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: The voice on the comm gave three days. I don't have six hours to spend
      not moving.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 91758df9fbb67ea4d941b480e04c91fd, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Then we move. If a dead operative's file survived anywhere, it's on Velorum.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c0c0b94320e48d14d9e4a2c2888b37e8, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Auction-world. They sell weapons up top, people down the bottom, and file
      the paperwork on both.
    seconds: 9
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 21706b046d72bae448e129d5101a1c74, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: You know it.
    seconds: 1.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: be814bc07e30b594e9bfec2f7bc9a797, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: I know it the way you know a wound. I swore I'd never set foot on that
      rock again.
    seconds: 8
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 72f6d9e796fdcd04cb262e303e90a128, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: And here I am, plotting a course back for a man I scraped out of a coffin.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fdadcc25546519745aab973cd9fbcd21, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Why.
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b42feff07d4519b46a62b1ac1efa40a8, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Because somebody has to find out who they buried in my casket. Might as
      well be the two of us.
    seconds: 8
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 89b237c01ef457b4ab2a6c90c8f1cd81, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Then set the course.
    seconds: 2
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3515dd6ded2fd3a469a475cfcd80e7e4, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Already set. Strap in. Velorum doesn't get gentler the closer you get.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1d3924e6ffa4d5041899b8a2b23bf28b, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 2014963364}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 1896477192}
  audioSource: {fileID: 875354848}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
