--- !u!114 &1408893621
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1408893620}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Mira
    text: ...Is the loud part over? Up there. It's loud.
    seconds: 3
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 550c2631eab0d1741b70fe9b8ea3c3c7, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: ...That's a child. Resh, that is a child standing in my hold.
    seconds: 4
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 63ca305c7e3c7e04d8b4fcbc0737f48c, type: 3}
  - speaker: Resh
    text: She stowed away. Off the auction floor. She's market stock that walked
      off the shelf on her own legs.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f3a087df56f099e4aa4b65f5213a80f0, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: I'm not in the business of turning a child back toward a cage. Not on this
      ship.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 884e25966e238c5488cadeb9efd8d926, type: 3}
  - speaker: Mira
    text: Are you going to send me back.
    seconds: 3
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 79434fd122fce204fb9d6ef395c21140, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: No.
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 24039ae8bd3bdb64caaecf61d971b682, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Nobody puts you back. You stay with the ship. You stay where Kessler can
      see you.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ef7e6c09c5fed144b9f772945a81cbaa, type: 3}
  - speaker: Resh
    text: ...That's twice today you've done a thing your kind doesn't do.
    seconds: 4
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 788b519fda55cf645b3661f01db5815a, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: Then she stays. She stays aboard, with me, same as Iris. I have the room
      and I have the reason.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dacf53e85cf84da40b70deed9ca5fb59, type: 3}
  - speaker: Resh
    text: A salvage rat, a freed tech, a stowaway, and me. Hell of a manifest.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ff589094fdc053342af43d3a6ad1f09b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Get some rest. Velorum can keep the rest of it.
    seconds: 3
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 03320d115596a8946b6b1af52f58f634, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 2049848151}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 1314055981}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1408893622}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
