  - component: {fileID: 1918574514}
  - component: {fileID: 1918574513}
  - component: {fileID: 1918574512}
  m_Layer: 0
  m_Name: Dialogue_Beat4_Reveal
  m_TagString: Untagged
  m_Icon: {fileID: 0}
  m_NavMeshLayer: 0
  m_StaticEditorFlags: 0
  m_IsActive: 1
--- !u!114 &1918574512
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1918574511}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Resh
    text: Door's mine. Terminal's clear now that the muscle's down. Iris, it's yours.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ad5a2aeb478e5b848801a3cdbd9da6f4, type: 3}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: Every one of these is a person. Dead operatives, jettisoned, then bought
      back here as salvage.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cbc08d3c3dda4ff499a3089fc175375f, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: The same trade that put me in front of Kessler. A box thrown out as garbage.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fa1762e44a20bdf468f97c3715aa63e7, type: 3}
  - speaker: Resh
    text: I've spent my whole life pulling people out of a place that's built on
      bodies.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3d41e6b796539a449bc702d3ca3c264d, type: 3}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: ...There's one here under your designation. Filed with the dead. It's yours.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e77f32fdf5b91324080032b4bdeaacb2, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Read it.
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 56e285ab879dd004f96d7fe1569838bd, type: 3}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: This is your termination order. Executed. Signed off.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6510055ac61908a47993ce847a8187a9, type: 3}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: The killswitch discharged. Full sequence.
    seconds: 3
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a528c4a7ee6df4e47b2561adfec15470, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Then why am I reading it?
    seconds: 2.5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 00e5eeeefae39854284ab61335a080e6, type: 3}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: Because it didn't take. It fired into your skull, full discharge, and you
      just kept breathing.
    seconds: 8
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9eb9c0394cb60fa449382ae30b429e8a, type: 3}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: Every one of you has this. A leash in the skull. Yours is the only one
      on record that failed.
    seconds: 8
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1cd4cdc26cfc5194ab6ca5f83e833dd0, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: No.
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c69e51b3537de8247a2360b59bc809b5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Mine's the only one they've found that failed.
    seconds: 4
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fe275be265bf34045a610587d13b036f, type: 3}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: ...You think there are more of you. Ones that slipped and nobody caught
      it.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a0cf90f6dd2f07446a5ca28548f6b6e6, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: A leash that broke once on me can break on others. The men who built it
      don't know that yet.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d15f1547eff9a3547ad20a9c5a28e19b, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: I pulled a man out of a coffin who'd already been executed. I didn't know
      nothing was ever supposed to come out of it.
    seconds: 11
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 89ec0c663e5db5c489857ae565120e3a, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: Copy it. The file, and the others. Every leash in this room.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8eda02bed5dc73f4bb83b39a4fbc9657, type: 3}
  - speaker: Iris
    text: Copying. It'll take both of us a lifetime to read what's in here.
    seconds: 4
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d7dbdd96e12704244a80d94a57ca15d7, type: 3}
  - speaker: Resh
    text: Then it's a good thing you found a crew. Door's clear. Let's get Kessler's
      girl home before this market notices what it just sold us for free.
    seconds: 12
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dadcb70820806c14885e08e2707e8229, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 383991907}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 1101754146}
  audioSource: {fileID: 1918574513}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
