--- !u!114 &2136033890
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2136033889}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51bf743a7b9a61e409329faa416e2f81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Ronin7.World::Ronin7.World.Story.DialoguePlayer
  lines:
  - speaker: Resh
    text: You're a turned one. A Program weapon walking around with a salvage rat
      and an open hand.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: eee70a5418a49764ea3182a27b005b4e, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: And yet.
    seconds: 1
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 27e0b203cd4c93640808ecc294cc4278, type: 3}
  - speaker: Resh
    text: I pull children out of this market. One at a time. For every one I get
      out, the machine takes ten more.
    seconds: 8
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cb7ed2902105d1640a7911006964f422, type: 3}
  - speaker: Ronin-7
    text: I came here for a route. That's all.
    seconds: 3
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7dcf634b258b89b44908b9132ca6a789, type: 3}
  - speaker: Resh
    text: I'm your way past that broker. But I don't want paying off and waved away.
      I want in.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5a5b7e96a6861594e80d92f4ae4e096e, type: 3}
  - speaker: Resh
    text: You're the first crack I've seen in a wall I've spent twenty years smuggling
      around.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 40e2ee8f75372de49a36c1bcd252db32, type: 3}
  - speaker: Kessler
    text: This is bigger than robbing a stall. This is the Dominion.
    seconds: 5
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ed96155b77770f94eb386c8a252a6d32, type: 3}
  - speaker: Resh
    text: I've known exactly who I'm crossing since I was younger than the kids I
      haul out of here.
    seconds: 7
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6b41629edec4e3540a194ac684e05bb5, type: 3}
  - speaker: Resh
    text: The difference today is who I'd be crossing it with. Best odds I've ever
      had.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bf5ff1350e3729c4e920c1f005fc0732, type: 3}
  - speaker: Resh
    text: I caught a lead this morning. Movement through the cells, collateral being
      shifted.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3eba079b87c536f4d94d5daf83f82c20, type: 3}
  - speaker: Resh
    text: My routes run the same corridor as your broker's vault. We pick it up on
      the way.
    seconds: 6
    clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a52fee3ce20d81446bb22aec71be1118, type: 3}
  textMesh: {fileID: 419892457}
  panelRoot: {fileID: 910056250}
  audioSource: {fileID: 2136033891}
  billboardToCamera: 1
  playOnStart: 0
  followDistance: 1.5
  followVerticalOffset: -0.55
  followLerp: 12
  maxCharsPerLine: 36
  autoAdvanceBeat: 0.45
  advanceAction: {fileID: -3790664182463143341, guid: d5a2441a867c2484c888f3631c932d48, type: 3}
